    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>规则怪谈：是怪谈的种类之一</span></p><p><span>是以规章制度、条例或者小纸条的形式呈现</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a>今天给大家带来一场规则怪谈，若承受能力有限，请立刻退出本节目。</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="50">00:50</a>清洁工守则</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="340">05:40</a>员工守则</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="551">09:11</a>十六的工作日记</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="911">15:11</a>规则怪谈到这里就结束啦</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="912">15:12</a>下面是广告时间</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="937">15:37</a>各位听众朋友们</span></p><p><span>我们有缘再会</span></p>]]></description>
