  <item>
    <title>万圣节的烤曲奇</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/636921af165a4944db4975aa</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">636921af165a4944db4975aa</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 07 Nov 2022 15:18:06 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>虽然刚搬家就有“艳遇”这种事听起来似乎不错，但这种莫名其妙的礼物还是不收为妙。</span></p><p><span>在万圣节没有要到糖果饼干就对小女孩使坏？</span></p><p><span>粉红毛衣女为什么那么执着的给我送曲奇？</span></p><p><span>鲜红色胎记！就是她！</span></p><p><span>你逃不掉了！！！</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="28">00:28</a></span></p><p><span>我们的故事开始了</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="97">01:37</a></span></p><p><span>粉色毛衣女是?</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="138">02:18</a></span></p><p><span>刚搬家就碰到了艳遇/狗头</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="216">03:36</a>她又来了</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="415">06:55</a>陈年旧事-平凡中不普通的万圣节</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="564">09:24</a>最后一根稻草的掉落</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="641">10:41</a>她回来了	</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="717">11:57</a>你喜欢吃烤曲奇吗?</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="730">12:10</a>这个故事就到这里啦</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lo96FbsMRCeWYv1RNVf2IIMxv-0N.m4a" length="15330726" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:12:39</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cHM6Ly9pbWFnZS54eXpjZG4ubmV0L0ZnLVlmNlhpTE9kSTV4ZnAzY3ZoVG05TTI4MnMucG5n.png"/>
